# W9: a generated session title (`.prd/tui-phase4` W9). The fake gateway
# answers the title request with titles-answer.json -- a quoted first line and
# a second line, so the cleaning shows -- and the turn with titles-turns.json.
# The status line's session segment is on (seeded), so the title is drawn in
# the footer as well as the window; then `/new`, so the titled session is one
# the `/resume` picker lists (neither binary lists the session it is in).
gateway titles-turns.json
titled titles-answer.json
seed titles-seed.json
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 3
snap launch
title launch
type fix the renderer loop, it redraws every row twice
key Enter
wait 4
snap answered
title answered
type /new
key Enter
wait 2
type /resume
key Enter
wait 2
snap resume
gwlog
home files
